{"id": "q0068", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "local", "tier": "never", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 4093614844, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "923cbbdfe3213927dfa36b1f8e0eb48a30d641d9b9bf7cf25d16765340d88836", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 3, "query": "In a family, there are 2 brothers and 3 sisters. All sisters are the same age, which is 16. One of the brothers is 12 years old, which is half the age of the older brother. What is the total age of all these siblings?\n\nShow your work and end with the final numeric answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0068.wav", "input_sha256": "ec3173c9c40b131f065591b344ef6b49756d2d167f3d63288d359278d48b5179", "input_samples": 284400, "input_s": 17.775, "n_real_chunks": 18, "score": 0.1533, "act": 0.997, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "So, there are two brothers. One brother is 1 2 years old, and the other brother is twice that age, so he's 2 4 years old. There' s three sisters, all of them are 16 years old. So, let's add up the ages: 12 plus 24 is 36 for the boys. And then 16 times 3 is 4 8 for the girls. Add those together, it' s 3 6 plus 48, which is 8 4. The total age of all these siblings is 84.", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 18, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 29, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0068_local_local.wav", "sha256": "62baf0c0f00edb2b28dd8d93ed0c169fd62cd9a8535c431370cb7b05e5c0c4d2", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 28.92}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.057, 1.102, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.059, 2.104, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.