{"id": "q0101", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "local", "tier": "never", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3720081385, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "923cbbdfe3213927dfa36b1f8e0eb48a30d641d9b9bf7cf25d16765340d88836", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 3, "query": "Riproarin' Ringo was roping a recalcitrant dogie. Ringo decided to give the dogie a reprieve by calculating \\[|(1-i)^8|\\]before riding after the dogie. What answer should Ringo have found?\n\nSolve and give the final answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0101.wav", "input_sha256": "1ec9e7f5f9ada392c830d2d5b2f748a327a5dac43cbc6c5604f062faa0a5104d", "input_samples": 222000, "input_s": 13.875, "n_real_chunks": 14, "score": 0.5336, "act": 0.9984, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "1 minus 8 equal s negative 7.", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 14, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 3, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0101_local_local.wav", "sha256": "cffd6d3f9c3e67ab5bdea289ea3f58cfd18d0a923c1c5cd3d068b01d69310213", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 2.88}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.059, 1.104, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.055, 2.098, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.057, 3.101, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.055, 4.101, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.057, 5.103, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.056, 6.101, 1, 0, 0], [6, 1, 7.0, 7.058, 7.104, 1, 0, 0], [7, 1, 8.0, 8.057, 8.102, 1, 0, 0], [8, 1, 9.0, 9.058, 9.103, 1, 0, 0], [9, 1, 10.0, 10.058, 10.102, 1, 0, 0], [10, 1, 11.0, 11.059, 11.103, 1, 0, 0], [11, 1, 12.0, 12.058, 12.102, 1, 0, 0], [12, 1, 13.0, 13.059, 13.105, 1, 0, 0], [13, 1, 13.875, 13.934, 13.976, 1, 0, 0], [14, 0, 14.875, 14.936, 15.481, 0, 24000, 0], [15, 0, 15.875, 15.936, 16.501, 0, 24000, 0], [16, 0, 16.875, 16.934, 17.358, 0, 21120, 1]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 13.875, "last_real_feed_done": 13.934, "onset": 15.481, "gate_read_done": 15.481, "fire": null, "candidate_first_pcm": null, "stall_note": null, "stall_first_pcm": null, "local_first_pcm": 15.481, "wait_start": null, "expert_req": null, "expert_resp": null, "relay_synth_start": null, "relay_first_pcm": null, "relay_synth_end": null, "first_any_pcm": 15.481, "first_answer_pcm": 15.481, "session_end": 17.358}, "ttfa_answer_s": 1.606, "ttfa_any_s": 1.606}
{"id": "q0117", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "local", "tier": "never", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 767785885, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "923cbbdfe3213927dfa36b1f8e0eb48a30d641d9b9bf7cf25d16765340d88836", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 3, "query": "Let $z = 2 + \\sqrt{2} - (3 + 3 \\sqrt{2})i$, and let $c = 2 - 3i$.  Let $w$ be the result when $z$ is rotated around $c$ by $\\frac{\\pi}{4}$ counter-clockwise.\n\n[asy]\nunitsize(0.6 cm);\n\npair C, W, Z;\n\nZ = (2 + sqrt(2), -3 - 3*sqrt(2));\nC = (2,-3);\nW = rotate(45,C)*(Z);\n\ndraw(Z--C--W);\n\ndot(\"$c$\", C, N);\ndot(\"$w$\", W, SE);\ndot(\"$z$\", Z, S);\nlabel(\"$\\frac{\\pi}{4}$\", C + (0.6,-1));\n[/asy]\n\nFind $w.$\n\nSolve and give the final answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0117.wav", "input_sha256": "a4ec9baee8bdbfc79d9150b0c10f81b383e91953897fdfc2f63c8d540224ffc9", "input_samples": 451600, "input_s": 28.225, "n_real_chunks": 29, "score": 0.9584, "act": 0.9945, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "Okay, so we have z equal s 2 plus square root of two i minus three plus three square root of two i, and c equals two minus three i. We want to rotate z around c by pi over four counterclock wise to get w. So first, let' s find the complex number representing the rotation. A rotation by an angle theta in the complex plane is given by multiplying by e to the i theta. Here, theta is pi over four, so the rotation factor is e to the i pi over four. This can be written as cos pi over four plus i sin pi over four, which is root two over two plus i root two over two. Now, to rotate z around c, we translate the origin to c by sub tracting c from z, apply the rotation, and then translate back by adding c. So, w equal s c plus the rotation factor times z minus c. Let me compute z minus c first. Z is 2 plus square root of two i minus three plus three square root of two i, which simplifies to negative one plus square root of two plus three square root of two i. That's negative one plus five root two i. Now,", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 28, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 60, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0117_local_local.wav", "sha256": "c9f15040cbee2dd75cdf51b61b7fc8c50870449fe112f90a97433cde96d43cc6", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 60.0}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.055, 1.096, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.056, 2.099, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.056, 3.1, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.057, 4.102, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.056, 5.101, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.055, 6.101, 1, 0, 0], [6, 1, 7.0, 7.059, 7.103, 1, 0, 0], [7, 1, 8.0, 8.059, 8.104, 1, 0, 0], [8, 1, 9.0, 9.061, 9.104, 1, 0, 0], [9, 1, 10.0, 10.059, 10.102, 1, 0, 0], [10, 1, 11.0, 11.06, 11.105, 1, 0, 0], [11, 1, 12.0, 12.058, 12.103, 1, 0, 0], [12, 1, 13.0, 13.06, 13.105, 1, 0, 0], [13, 1, 14.0, 14.06, 14.105, 1, 0, 0], [14, 1, 15.0, 15.06, 15.106, 1, 0, 0], [15, 1, 16.0, 16.059, 16.104, 1, 0, 0], [16, 1, 17.0, 17.059, 17.105, 1, 0, 0], [17, 1, 18.0, 18.059, 18.105, 1, 0, 0], [18, 1, 19.0, 19.062, 19.108, 1, 0, 0], [19, 1, 20.0, 20.061, 20.106, 1, 0, 0], [20, 1, 21.0, 21.061, 21.106, 1, 0, 0], [21, 1, 22.0, 22.062, 22.107, 1, 0, 0], [22, 1, 23.0, 23.061, 23.107, 1, 0, 0], [23, 1, 24.0, 24.061, 24.11, 1, 0, 0], [24, 1, 25.0, 25.063, 25.108, 1, 0, 0], [25, 1, 26.0, 26.064, 26.11, 1, 0, 0], [26, 1, 27.0, 27.063, 27.11, 1, 0, 0], [27, 1, 28.0, 28.064, 28.111, 1, 0, 0], [28, 1, 28.225, 28.287, 28.738, 0, 24000, 0], [29, 0, 29.225, 29.284, 29.813, 0, 24000, 0], [30, 0, 30.225, 30.284, 30.821, 0, 24000, 0], [31, 0, 31.225, 31.285, 31.856, 0, 24000, 0]