{"id": "q0414", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "local", "tier": "never", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2986469580, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "923cbbdfe3213927dfa36b1f8e0eb48a30d641d9b9bf7cf25d16765340d88836", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 3, "query": "Imagine you are the last person on Earth. Write a diary entry describing your thoughts and feelings.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0414.wav", "input_sha256": "ba26eac91888d15cd14551685a410aca4829117e711530e0ddd9dd01070d5df9", "input_samples": 90800, "input_s": 5.675, "n_real_chunks": 6, "score": 0.801, "act": 0.9883, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "I can't believe it. The world is empty, and I' m the only one left. It's so quiet, too quiet. Every sound echoes without anyone to share it with. I keep thinking about all the people who were here just yesterday. Their laughter, their voices, even the way the wind rustled through the leaves seemed alive then. Now, everything feels frozen in time.I walk the streets like a ghost, passing familiar places— my favorite coffee shop, the park where we used to play, the library where I spent so many hours reading. Everything looks exactly as it did, but there's no warmth anymore. Just cold concrete and glass. Sometimes I wonder if this loneliness will ever end. Will I go mad from talking to myself? Or maybe I'll find some reason to keep going. I don't know. But for now, I have to keep writing, keep remember ing who I was before everything changed. Maybe someday, someone else will read these words and understand what happened. Until then, I'm still here, still breathing, still wondering why.", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 6, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 55, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0414_local_local.wav", "sha256": "4697d968fa8fff1b9829a255d8bea4cba1131292e4f908bd4f228a83b5e97755", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 55.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.06, 1.107, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.06, 2.105, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.061, 3.107, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.059, 4.105, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.062, 5.11, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 5.675, 5.735, 5.782, 1, 0, 0], [6, 0, 6.675, 6.736, 7.297, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.675, 7.736, 8.229, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.675, 8.738, 9.327, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.675, 9.736, 10.323, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.675, 10.737, 11.325, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.675, 11.737, 12.255, 0, 24000, 0], [12, 0, 12.675, 12.735, 13.216, 0, 24000, 0], [13, 0, 13.675, 13.739, 14.234, 0, 24000, 0], [14, 0, 14.675, 14.753, 15.26, 0, 24000, 0], [15, 0, 15.675, 15.738, 16.335, 0, 24000, 0], [16, 0, 16.675, 16.739, 17.253, 0, 24000, 0], [17, 0, 17.675, 17.74, 18.287, 0, 24000, 0], [18, 0, 18.675, 18.74, 19.302, 0, 24000, 0], [19, 0, 19.675, 19.738, 20.305, 0, 24000, 0], [20, 0, 20.675, 20.738, 21.302, 0, 24000, 0], [21, 0, 21.675, 21.739, 22.209, 0, 24000, 0], [22, 0, 22.675, 22.742, 23.396, 0, 24000, 0], [23, 0, 23.675, 23.741, 24.235, 0, 24000, 0], [24, 0, 24.675, 24.741, 25.296, 0, 24000, 0], [25, 0, 25.675, 25.741, 26.21, 0, 24000, 0], [26, 0, 26.675, 26.744, 27.267, 0, 24000, 0], [27, 0, 27.675, 27.741, 28.259, 0, 24000, 0], [28, 0, 28.675, 28.743, 29.349, 0, 24000, 0], [29, 0, 29.675, 29.739, 30.278, 0, 24000, 0], [30, 0, 30.675, 30.738, 31.195, 0, 24000, 0], [31, 0, 31.675, 31.74, 32.303, 0, 24000, 0], [32, 0, 32.675, 32.739, 33.263, 0, 24000, 0], [33, 0, 33.675, 33.739, 34.328, 0, 24000, 0], [34, 0, 34.675, 34.741, 35.344, 0, 24000, 0], [35, 0, 35.675, 35.74, 36.285, 0, 24000, 0], [36, 0, 36.675, 36.744, 37.259, 0, 24000, 0], [37, 0, 37.675, 37