{"id": "q0459", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "local", "tier": "never", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2833011061, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "923cbbdfe3213927dfa36b1f8e0eb48a30d641d9b9bf7cf25d16765340d88836", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 3, "query": "What are some basic spirits you should have at your bar", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0459.wav", "input_sha256": "b29397119c0a30b55bf41a0cf43e057efabfde6654c1c5de5231e6048ba54b24", "input_samples": 52400, "input_s": 3.275, "n_real_chunks": 4, "score": 0.772, "act": 0.9994, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "Well, I think the most basic spirits you should have at your bar are going to be things like vodka and gin. Those are really versatile base s that can be used for a lot of different cocktails. You could also have some rum or whiskey as well. But those three would probably cover the majority of what you need.", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 20, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0459_local_local.wav", "sha256": "246599099c0cacaa7d34f92da8e3c7d8fd432e6c52a145e8520b7fdcab23bb24", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 20.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.059, 1.105, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.061, 2.108, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.06, 3.106, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 3.275, 3.335, 3.834, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 4.275, 4.336, 4.869, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.275, 5.336, 5.84, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.275, 6.337, 6.886, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.275, 7.338, 7.871, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.275, 8.338, 8.874, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.275,