{"id": "q0490", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "local", "tier": "never", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2109056733, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "923cbbdfe3213927dfa36b1f8e0eb48a30d641d9b9bf7cf25d16765340d88836", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 3, "query": "制定可追溯性计划。", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0490.wav", "input_sha256": "1abf5a81e5e2683e04690d713116ffb37d7e0d5227ad8d8f36cdefa131f73aa8", "input_samples": 28800, "input_s": 1.8, "n_real_chunks": 2, "score": 0.3669, "act": 0.9879, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "制定可追溯性计划，首先要明确目标和范围。你得先确定需要追踪哪些产品或流程，比如是食品、医药还是其他商品。然后梳理整个供应链，从原料采购到生产、包装、物流以及销售的每个环节，确保所有参与方都清楚自己的责任。接着选择合适的技术工具，比如条码系统、RFID或者数据平台，用来记录产品信息。建立标准化的数据格式也很重要，这样不同部门之间才能顺利交换信息。别忘了定期检查和更新系统，确保数据准确且实时。同时还要建立应急响应机制，一旦出现问题能快速定位源头并采取措施。最后，培训员工了解操作流程，确保计划真正落地执行。总之，有序规划加强协作，才能让可追", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 5, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 60, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0490_local_local.wav", "sha256": "db6ac94352eb2efd5efd5bafa14e51d0048a2ecfb94f093a013e97cf98cc62e9", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 60.0}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.064, 1.116, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 1.8, 1.863, 1.91, 1, 0, 0], [2, 0, 2.8, 2.86, 2.908, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.8, 3.856, 3.905, 1, 0, 0], [4, 0, 4.8, 4.86, 4.909, 1, 0, 0], [5, 0, 5.8, 5.859, 6.475, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.8, 6.86, 7.374, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.8, 7.865, 8.412, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.8, 8.862, 9.461, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.8, 9.861, 10.366, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.8, 10.858, 11.355, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.8, 11.86, 12.421, 0, 2400