{"id": "q0506", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "local", "tier": "never", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 1154929302, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "923cbbdfe3213927dfa36b1f8e0eb48a30d641d9b9bf7cf25d16765340d88836", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 3, "query": "为什么自我关怀很重要？", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0506.wav", "input_sha256": "b912307b1293e17bbf9902865775747d8010463ba615a73311cde4c762198267", "input_samples": 37200, "input_s": 2.325, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.2084, "act": 0.9951, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "自我关怀很重要，因为它能帮助我们照顾好自己的身心健康。我们每天都会经历压力、疲劳和情绪低落，如果不学会善待自己，很容易被压垮。自我关怀让我们有力量去面对困难，同时也能保持内心的平静与韧性。比如好好吃饭、休息、运动或只是花点时间放空自己，都是在给身体充电。只要我们善待自己，就更容易以积极的心态面对生活的起起伏伏。所以别忘了关爱自己，这并不是自私，而是生存的必要之道。", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 47, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0506_local_local.wav", "sha256": "cff6cc13f56757878079ff6807df3341493e440719df473619bac8844df04264", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 46.4}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.059, 1.105, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.059, 2.102, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 2.325, 2.385, 2.429, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.325, 3.387, 3.766, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 4.325, 4.389, 4.932, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.325, 5.387, 5.981, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.325, 6.387, 6.921, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.325, 7.389, 7.902, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.325, 8.388, 8.916, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.325, 9.39, 9.881, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.325, 10.389, 10.912, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.325, 11.388, 11.958, 0, 24000, 0], [12, 0, 12.325, 12.389, 12.915, 0, 24000, 0], 