{"id": "q0526", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "local", "tier": "never", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 1994436628, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "923cbbdfe3213927dfa36b1f8e0eb48a30d641d9b9bf7cf25d16765340d88836", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 3, "query": "提出在交通领域减少碳排放的解决方案。", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0526.wav", "input_sha256": "ec15ad0632b764a9823d82f868dd7ebda73b58052ec2a5081db02723a627a205", "input_samples": 63200, "input_s": 3.95, "n_real_chunks": 4, "score": 0.3497, "act": 0.9976, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "我认为在交通领域减少碳排放的最佳方式之一是发展公共交通，比如地铁和公交车。这样可以减少私人汽车的数量，从而降低整体的碳排放量。另外，推广电动汽车也是一个很好的选择，因为它们不像传统油车那样产生废气。还有就是鼓励大家多步行或骑自行车，这不仅环保，还能促进身体健康。总之，通过这些措施，我们可以有效减少交通领域的碳排放。", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 4, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 33, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0526_local_local.wav", "sha256": "ca5941cd77f965f7e2478b42ba02deb2620a299978f0314ba927299dd38e8fe3", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 32.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.058, 1.102, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.06, 2.106, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.061, 3.106, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 3.95, 4.006, 4.053, 1, 0, 0], [4, 0, 4.95, 5.007, 5.405, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.95, 6.012, 6.545, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.95, 7.01, 7.55, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.95, 8.012, 8.522, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.95, 9.011, 9.523, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.95, 10.013, 10.544, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.95, 11.012, 11.509, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.95, 12.014, 12.564, 0, 24000, 0], [12, 0, 12.95, 13.013, 13.511, 0, 24000, 0], [13, 0, 13.95, 14.014, 14.549, 0, 